{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/5c37b3c437d1abe947e00aca2bb2c221.poster.avif?t=1756742898\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/5c37b3c437d1abe947e00aca2bb2c221.webm?t=1756742898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455780/extras/5c37b3c437d1abe947e00aca2bb2c221.mp4?t=1756742898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captured by a space anomaly, you find yourself stranded in another universe! Fortunately, your ship is equipped for mining and crafting. Harvest exotic resources, manufacture components, and construct a massive inter-dimensional portal - your only hope of getting back home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Eventide Matter features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Rare Resources:</strong> Mine 6 unique materials and craft them into advanced components.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Ship:</strong> Unlock and enhance around 10 module types, including lasers, thrusters, tractor beams, drones, and shields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Capabilities:</strong> Research dozens of permanent upgrades in a sprawling tech tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the Machine:</strong> Assemble the complex portal piece by piece, through multiple intricate layers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Your Work:</strong> Survive relentless enemies that pursue you and seek to destroy your progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2455780?t=1756742898","backgro